Data
----
NASA Physical Sciences Informatics (PSI), https://psi.nasa.gov
  - PSI-25  BASS-II experimental table       CC0-1.0   DOI 10.60555/4qc4-de67   (data/evidence/fixtures/)
  - PSI-69  FLEX experimental table          CC0-1.0   DOI 10.60555/mbq8-0451   (data/evidence/psi-69-flex.csv)
  - PSI-99  Saffire-II experimental table    CC0-1.0   DOI 10.60555/2chp-m469   (data/evidence/psi-99-saffire-2.csv)
  - ACME, CFI and SPICE experimental tables, engineering documents and reports (Pseudo_DataKeep/).
    Their PSI identifiers, access dates and licence terms are not yet recorded in this repository.

NASA Technical Reports Server (NTRS), https://ntrs.nasa.gov
  - NASA/TM-20210011385, "Burning and Suppression of Solids-II (BASS-II) Summary Report". Tables 5.1, 7.1,
    A.2 and 2.1 are transcribed in data/evidence/, each row with its table and printed page.

Quoted, with source and location, in data/evidence/fire-response.json:
  - NASA OCHMO-TB-008 Rev A, Fire Protection
  - NASA papers on the Saffire experiments (ICES-2021-266, ICES-2024-365) and related NTRS records

Cited by title and link, not reproduced:
  - Scientific Reports (2018), "The Effect of Gravity on Flame Spread over PMMA Cylinders"
  - Fire Safety Journal (2024), "Partial gravity flammability of cast PMMA rods"

Each provenance file in data/evidence/ records how its rows were obtained and whether an independent check
has been done.

